        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>分组法数学题手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdfdfa;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 45px 30px 20px 28px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    /* simulate ruled notebook lines */\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0px,\n      transparent 25px,\n      #e4e6e8 25px,\n      #e4e6e8 26px\n    );\n  }\n  .red { color: #d92b2b; }\n  .green { color: #1f7a3a; }\n  .black { color: #1a1a1a; }\n\n  .problem {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n  }\n  .problem .stem {\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .stem .l2 {\n    display: block;\n    margin-left: 18px;\n  }\n  .method {\n    margin-left: 48px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .method .lvl1 { margin-left: 0; }\n  .method .lvl2 { margin-left: 18px; }\n  .method .lvl3 { margin-left: 36px; }\n  .gap { display: inline-block; width: 34px; }\n  .gap-lg { display: inline-block; width: 60px; }\n  .blockgap { height: 10px; }\n  .footer-mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 22px;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #b9bcc0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- 第 2 题 -->\n  <div class=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"stem green\">\n      2、光明小学师生100人共画了100幅画，老师1人画3幅，学生3人画1幅，\n      <span class=\"l2\">画画的老师、学生各有多少人？</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"method black\">\n      <div class=\"lvl1\">分组法</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">1个老师和3个学生画的画的幅数：<span class=\"gap\"></span>3 + 1 = 4（幅）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">共100幅画，每4幅为一组，共分的组数：<span class=\"gap\"></span>100 ÷ 4 = 25（组）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">老师：<span class=\"gap\"></span>25 × 1 = 25（人）<span class=\"gap-lg\"></span>学生：25 × 3 = 75（人）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"blockgap\"></div>\n\n  <!-- 第 3 题 -->\n  <div class=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"stem red\">\n      3、又鸟、兔共38，鸡比兔多26只，脚数共有274只，鸡、兔各有多少只？\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"method black\">\n      <div class=\"lvl1\">分组法</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">去掉26只鸡，脚数减少：26 × 2 = 52（只）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">脚数共剩下：<span class=\"gap\"></span>274 − 52 = 222（只）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">把1只鸡和1只兔看作 1 组</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl3\">每组里脚数：<span class=\"gap\"></span>2 + 4 = 6（只）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl3\">222只脚可分成：<span class=\"gap\"></span>222 ÷ 6 = 37（组）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl3\">鸡：37 × 1 + 26 = 63（只）<span class=\"gap-lg\"></span>兔：37 × 1 = 37（只）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"blockgap\"></div>\n\n  <!-- 第 4 题 -->\n  <div class=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"stem red\">\n      4、100个和尚吃100个馒头。大和尚一人吃3个，小和尚3人吃一个，\n      <span class=\"l2\">大、小和尚各多少人？</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"method black\">\n      <div class=\"lvl1\">分组法</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">1个大和尚和3个小和尚共吃的馒头个数：<span class=\"gap\"></span>3 + 1 = 4（个）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">共100个馒头，每4个馒头为一组，共分的组数：<span class=\"gap\"></span>100 ÷ 4 = 25（组）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">大和尚：<span class=\"gap\"></span>25 × 1 = 25（人）</div>\n      <div class=\"lvl2\">小和尚：<span class=\"gap\"></span>25 × 3 = 75（人）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-mark\">[illegible]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
